# Path decides who reviews. This is the main payoff of separating the content
# plane from the infrastructure plane: a rule tuning PR needs a detection
# engineer, a change to rules.tf needs platform review.
#
# Replace these team handles with your own before committing.

*                               @your-org/soc-leads

/detections/rules/endpoint/     @your-org/soc-endpoint-detections
/detections/rules/identity/     @your-org/soc-identity-detections
/detections/rules/network/      @your-org/soc-network-detections
/detections/rules/cloud/        @your-org/soc-cloud-detections
/detections/exceptions/         @your-org/soc-leads

