/detections/schemas/            @your-org/soc-leads @your-org/platform-engineering

/terraform/                     @your-org/platform-engineering
/tools/                         @your-org/platform-engineering
/Jenkinsfile                    @your-org/platform-engineering
/local/                         @your-org/platform-engineering
